12
01:05:41,052 --> 01:05:47,052
The Vow is a 2012 American romantic drama film directed by Michael
Sucsy and starring Rachel McAdams and Channing Tatum.

13
01:11:09,473 --> 01:11:15,473
Written by Abby Kohn, Marc Silverstein, and Jason Katims, the film was
inspired by the true story of Kim and Krickitt Carpenter.

14
01:16:37,894 --> 01:16:43,894
In addition to McAdams and Tatum as Paige and Leo Collins, the cast includes Sam Neill,
Scott Speedman, Jessica Lange and Jessica McNamee in supporting roles.

15
01:22:06,315 --> 01:22:12,315
As of 2013, The Vow was the eighth highest-grossing
romantic drama film produced since 1980.

16
01:27:34,736 --> 01:27:40,736
This was Spyglass Entertainment's last film before the
company's closure in 2012 and its revival in 2019.

17
01:33:03,157 --> 01:33:09,157
The film explores themes of amnesia, coma, based on
true story, romance, memory loss.

18
01:38:31,578 --> 01:38:37,578
The tone is emotional and mind_bending.
